From 71103b6fe9c374663100591edd2fe8de0ea108b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 18:59:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] feat(core): carry channelData through dispatch, enrich
 hooks, and harden plugin infrastructure

- Plumb channelData through dispatch pipeline and enrich delivery metadata
- Support hook-level model override and resolve aliases in slug generator
- Expose replyToId/threadId in message hook metadata
- Prevent late plugin reloads from destroying global hook runner
- Restore fallback channel resolution to use isKnownChannel only
- Support embedded plugins from Bun compiled binary
- Add config schema for new agent/gateway/skill/tool options

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
